cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository's software or results, please cite the archived software release. A companion IEEE Access manuscript is under revision and has no publication DOI yet."
type: software
title: "GSD–PI: Reproducibility Package for Degree-Based Intrusion Screening"
abstract: >-
  Research code, executable notebooks, and aggregate validation evidence for
  the Graph Structural Differentiability and Prominence Isolation (GSD–PI)
  diagnostic of active-source out-degree screening. Includes a corrected
  selection policy, external benchmark audits, sensitivity analysis,
  statistical checks, and runtime profiles. Some original source-level
  inputs are not redistributed; this is not an independently verified
  end-to-end reproduction.
authors:
  - family-names: "Albluwi"
    given-names: "Abdulhadi"
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/AbdalhadiB/GSD-PI-Structural-Validity-IDS"
url: "https://github.com/AbdalhadiB/GSD-PI-Structural-Validity-IDS"
keywords:
  - intrusion detection
  - out-degree screening
  - network security
  - GSD–PI
  - structural feasibility
  - prominence isolation
  - reproducibility
